{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## L = 1: the functional $\\mathcal A_A=\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle$ as an overlap $\\langle v|\\Psi_A\\rangle$\n\n$$\n\\langle f\\rangle=\\frac{N_n}{f(\\theta+\\lambda_2h)}\\oint \\mu(u)\\,f(u),\\qquad \\mu(u)=\\frac{1}{\\nu_1(u)\\,\\nu_1(u+h)\\cdots\\nu_1(u+(\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2)h)},\n$$\nwith the contour around all poles $u=\\theta+nh$, $n=\\lambda_2,\\dots,\\lambda_1$, and the $2\\pi i$ absorbed into $N_n$.\n\n**Result** (checked for $[2,1,0]$, $[3,1,0]$, $[3,2,0]$; summary table in cell 13). Write $d=\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2$.\n- **Normalization.** Taking $N_n=1/\\mathrm{Res}_{\\theta+\\lambda_2h}\\,\\mu=(-1)^d\\,d!\\,h^d$ makes the constant term 1. The functional is then a $d$-th finite difference:\n$$\n\\langle f\\rangle=\\sum_{m=0}^{d}(-1)^m\\binom{d}{m}\\frac{f(\\theta+(\\lambda_2+m)h)}{f(\\theta+\\lambda_2h)}.\n$$\n  So $\\mathcal A_A$ is a polynomial of degree $d$ in $k_1$.\n- **Overlap.** With $\\langle\\text{vacL}|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1$ as in `L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame.wb`, $\\mathcal A_A=\\langle v|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ for every state, with\n$$\n\\langle v|=(1-k_1z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}\\,e_1^T\\,e^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}},\\qquad p_1'=p_1\\,\\frac{1-k_1z_2}{1-k_1z_1}.\n$$\n  Here $p_3$ is held at its vacL value $p_3(p_1,p_2)$. So $v$ is vacL, rescaled, with its $E_{12}$ rotation parameter shifted, and $\\langle v|_{k_1=0}=\\langle\\text{vacL}|$.\n  - For the adjoint, $e_1^TE_{12}^2=0$, so $\\langle v|=e_1^T[(1-k_1z_1)+k_1p_1(z_1-z_2)E_{12}]\\,g_0$. This form was read off exactly at two rational points (`ptListO`, cell 9).\n  - $[3,1,0]$ and $[3,2,0]$ were then predictions, confirmed to about $10^{-92}$ at every order in $k_1$.\n\n### Second factor $\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle_2$\n\n$$\n\\langle g\\rangle_2=\\frac{N_{n,2}}{g(\\theta)}\\oint\\frac{g(u)}{\\nu_3(u)\\,\\nu_3(u-h)\\cdots\\nu_3(u-\\lambda_2h)},\\qquad Q_{12}(u)=Q_1(u)Q_2(u-h)-Q_2(u)Q_1(u-h),\n$$\nwith poles at $\\theta,\\dots,\\theta+\\lambda_2h$ ($\\lambda_3=0$). With $N_{n,2}$ making the constant term 1, this is again a finite difference, $\\sum_m(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}\\,k_2^m\\,Q_{12}(\\theta+mh)/Q_{12}(\\theta)$.\n\n**Result** (checked for $[2,1,0]$, $[3,1,0]$, $[3,2,0]$; table in cell 17). The product $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle\\,\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle_2=\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ for every state, with\n$$\n\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|=\\langle v|\\,\\sum_{m=0}^{\\lambda_2}(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}\\,k_2^m\\;t_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta),\n$$\nand the normalized fused transfer matrices\n$$\nt_{\\{1,1\\}}(u)=\\frac{\\texttt{tG[2]}(u)}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u-h)},\\qquad\nt_{\\{2,2\\}}(u)=\\frac{\\texttt{tG[2]}(u)\\,\\texttt{tG[2]}(u+h)-\\texttt{tG[3]}(u+h)\\,\\texttt{tG[1]}(u)}{\\nu_1(u)\\nu_1(u-h)\\nu_1(u+h)\\nu_1(u)}.\n$$\n- $[2,1,0]$ and $[3,1,0]$ give $1-k_2\\,t_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta)$.\n- $[3,2,0]$ gives $1-2k_2\\,t_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta)+k_2^2\\,t_{\\{2,2\\}}(\\theta)$.\n- The coefficients are the same for every state and independent of $z,\\theta,h$. They were fit over all states and read off exactly.\n- The identity holds to about $10^{-85}$ at every order in $k_1,k_2$. It was checked at both rational points for $[2,1,0]$ and $[3,2,0]$, and at point 1 for $[3,1,0]$.\n- In the polynomial gauge, the adjoint coefficient reads $-k_2/(6h^2)$, since $\\nu_1(\\theta)\\nu_1(\\theta-h)=6h^2$.\n- $v_{\\rm tot}$ is *not* a rotated highest-weight covector (cell 16).\n\nThe $|\\Psi_A\\rangle$ are a basis, so each $v$ exists and is unique.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Λ, ν];\nΛ[1] = {2, 1, 0};\n\nν[n_][u_] := Product[(u - θ[l] - h Λ[l]〚n〛), {l, 1}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[Ee, ℒ, T, TG];\nEe[α_][i_, j_] := Ee[α][i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ[α]];\nℒ[α_][i_, j_][u_] := ℒ[α][i, j][u] = u IdentityMatrix[dim[Λ[α]]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] - h Ee[α][j, i];\nG = DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}];\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[i, j][u] = ℒ[1][i, j][u - θ[1]];\nTG[{i_, j_}][u_] := TG[i, j][u] = Sum[ℒ[1][i, k][u - θ[1]] G〚k, j〛, {k, 3}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*transfer matrices*)\nClearAll[QM, tG, QMG];\nQM[Ii_, Jj_][u_] :=\n    QM[Ii, Jj][u] =\n    Sum[\n        Signature[Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛] (\n            Dot @@ (T[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last]& /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}])\n        ),\n        {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}\n    ];\n\nQMG[Ii_, Jj_][u_] :=\n    QMG[Ii, Jj][u] =\n    Sum[\n        Signature[Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛] (\n            Dot @@ (TG[#][u + h - h Position[Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}], #] // Flatten // Last]& /@ Transpose[{Permutations[Ii]〚σ〛, Jj}])\n        ),\n        {σ, 1, Length[Permutations[Ii]]}\n    ];\n\n\ntG[a_][u_] := tG[a][u] = Sum[QMG[Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rotparams =\n    {\n        p3 → (p2 (-z[1] + z[3])) / (p1 (z[2] - z[3])),\n        r1 → (p1 (z[2] - z[3])) / (p2 (z[1] - z[2])),\n        r2 → (z[2] - z[3]) / (p2 z[1] - p2 z[2]),\n        r3 → (z[1] - z[3]) / (p1 (-z[2] + z[3]))\n    };",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "vacL = {UnitVector[dim[Λ[1]], 1]}.MatrixExp[p1 Ee[1][1, 2]].MatrixExp[p2 Ee[1][1, 3]].MatrixExp[p3 Ee[1][2, 3]] /. rotparams;\nvacR = MatrixExp[r1 Ee[1][3, 2]].MatrixExp[r2 Ee[1][3, 1]].MatrixExp[r3 Ee[1][2, 1]].Transpose[{UnitVector[dim[Λ[1]], 1]}] /. rotparams;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* which numeric point from ptListO (next cell) to use *)\nptIndexO = 1;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Numeric point (chosen by ptIndexO in the cell above), polynomial transfer matrices, right/left eigenstates. ---- *)\nClearAll[precO, ptListO, ptO, hO, thO, zO, lamO, dsO, tPolyO, coefO, rhoO, KO, statesO, vacLO, vacRO];\nprecO = 100;\n(* two rational points with unimodular z; closed forms are read off at both *)\nptListO = {\n    {h -> 1, θ[1] -> 1/3, z[1] -> 5/2, z[2] -> 7/3, z[3] -> 6/35, p1 -> 3/5, p2 -> 4/7},\n    {h -> 1/2, θ[1] -> 2/7, z[1] -> 3/2, z[2] -> 5/4, z[3] -> 8/15, p1 -> 2/3, p2 -> 5/7}\n};\nptO = ptListO[[ptIndexO]];\nhO = h /. ptO; thO = θ[1] /. ptO; zO = N[{z[1], z[2], z[3]} /. ptO, precO];\nlamO = Λ[1]; dsO = dim[lamO];\n\n(* TG carries no 1/ν1 normalization, so tG[a] is already polynomial in u (the old notebook's T_a) *)\ntPolyO[a_] := tPolyO[a] = Expand[tG[a][u]] /. ptO;\ncoefO[a_, k_] := coefO[a, k] = N[Coefficient[tPolyO[a], u, k], precO];\n\n(* a generic combination of the coefficient matrices of t1, t2 has a nondegenerate spectrum, so one Eigensystem diagonalizes all of them *)\nrhoO[a_, k_] := Prime[7 a + k + 1]/(11 + 2 a + k);\nKO = Sum[rhoO[a, k] coefO[a, k], {a, 2}, {k, 0, a}];\nvacLO = N[Flatten[vacL /. ptO], precO];\nvacRO = N[Flatten[vacR /. ptO], precO];\n\nstatesO = Module[{valsR, vecsR, valsL, vecsL},\n    {valsR, vecsR} = Eigensystem[KO];\n    {valsL, vecsL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[KO]];\n    Table[\n        Module[{v = vecsR[[s]], w = vecsL[[First @ Ordering[Abs[valsL - valsR[[s]]], 1]]], p, tau},\n            v = v / (vacLO . v);\n            w = w / (w . vacRO);\n            p = First @ Ordering[-Abs[v], 1];\n            tau = Table[Sum[(coefO[a, k] . v)[[p]] / v[[p]] u^k, {k, 0, a}], {a, 3}];\n            <|\n                \"ket\" -> v, \"bra\" -> w, \"t\" -> tau,\n                \"mu\" -> Table[Diagonal[Ee[1][i, i]][[p]], {i, 3}],\n                \"eigRes\" -> Max[Flatten @ Table[{Abs[coefO[a, k] . v - Coefficient[tau[[a]], u, k] v], Abs[w . coefO[a, k] - Coefficient[tau[[a]], u, k] w]}, {a, 3}, {k, 0, a}]],\n                \"wtRes\" -> Max[Flatten @ Table[Abs[N[Ee[1][i, i]] . v - Diagonal[Ee[1][i, i]][[p]] v], {i, 3}]]\n            |>\n        ],\n        {s, Length[valsR]}\n    ]\n];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rep Λ[1]\", Row[lamO, \",\"]},\n        {\"numeric point\", ptO},\n        {\"# states\", Length[statesO]},\n        {\"tG[1..3] polynomial in u\", And @@ (PolynomialQ[#, u] & /@ Flatten[Table[tPolyO[a], {a, 3}]])},\n        {\"min relative eigenvalue gap of the mixed matrix\", N[Min[Abs[Differences[Sort[Eigenvalues[KO]]]]] / Max[Abs[Eigenvalues[KO]]], 3]},\n        {\"max eigen residual (kets and bras, t1..t3)\", N[Max[statesO[[All, \"eigRes\"]]], 3]},\n        {\"max weight residual\", N[Max[statesO[[All, \"wtRes\"]]], 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"265\" data-out-n=\"3024\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"42\" data-sub-end=\"53\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3024]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.45em;vertical-align:-3.955em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.495em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.455em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.455em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.41em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.955em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep Λ[1]</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">numeric point</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.205em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tG[1..3] polynomial in u</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min relative eigenvalue gap of the mixed matrix</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max eigen residual (kets and bras, t1..t3)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.595em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max weight residual</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.955em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.41em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.955em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span cla