      {
       "data": "Out[3024]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rep $\\Lambda$[1]} & 2,1,0\\\\\\hline\\text{numeric point} & \\left\\{h\\to 1,\\theta \\left(1\\right)\\to \\frac{1}{3},z\\left(1\\right)\\to \\frac{5}{2},z\\left(2\\right)\\to \\frac{7}{3},z\\left(3\\right)\\to \\frac{6}{35},p1\\to \\frac{3}{5},p2\\to \\frac{4}{7}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# states} & 8\\\\\\hline\\text{tG[1..3] polynomial in u} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{min relative eigenvalue gap of the mixed matrix} & 0.00123\\\\\\hline\\text{max eigen residual (kets and bras, t1..t3)} & 0.\\times 10^{-95}\\\\\\hline\\text{max weight residual} & 0.\\,\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
