  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Structure of v: strip the vacL rotation, v = e1^T X . g0 with g0 = exp(p1 E12) exp(p2 E13) exp(p3 E23), and list the\n   nonzero components of e1^T X = v . g0^-1 by GT pattern (the numeric point is rational, so they rationalize exactly). ---- *)\nClearAll[g0A, vTildeA, vTildeRatA];\ng0A = N[MatrixExp[p1 Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3 Ee[1][2, 3]] /. rotparams /. ptO, precO];\nvTildeA = Expand[vA . Inverse[g0A]];\nvTildeRatA = Table[Expand[Rationalize[CoefficientList[vTildeA[[n]], k1], 10^-70] . k1^Range[0, Exponent[vTildeA[[n]], k1]]], {n, dsO}];\n\nGrid[\n    Prepend[\n        Select[Transpose[{ps[{lamO}], vTildeRatA}], #[[2]] =!= 0 &] /. {pat_, c_} :> {pat, Factor[c]},\n        {\"GT pattern\", \"component of v . g0^-1\"}\n    ],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
