      {
       "data": "Out[3058]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rep} & \\text{\\# poles} & \\text{Nn} & \\text{c\\_m} & \\text{max |closed form - v| (all k1 orders)}\\\\\\hline2,1,0 & 2 & -1 & \\left\\{1,-1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-94}\\\\\\hline3,1,0 & 3 & 2 & \\left\\{1,-2,1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-93}\\\\\\hline3,2,0 & 2 & -1 & \\left\\{1,-1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-94}\\\\\\hline2,2,0 & 1 & 1 & \\left\\{1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-94}\\\\\\hline4,2,0 & 3 & 2 & \\left\\{1,-2,1\\right\\} & 0.\\times 10^{-93}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a3d111ea-1941-48bf-8f55-2948a9012d52"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Second factor <k2^{u/h} Q_12>_2 with mu_2 = 1/(ν3(u) ν3(u-h) ... ν3(u-λ2 h)): poles at θ + k h, k = 0..λ2 (λ3 = 0),\n   normalized by g(θ), Nn2 making the constant term 1. For the adjoint this is 1 + c k2 Q_12(θ+h)/Q_12(θ).\n   Q_12(u) = Q_1(u) Q_2(u-h) - Q_2(u) Q_1(u-h), the bracket in Psi^ref.\n   Total A_A = <k1^{u/h} Q_1>_1 <k2^{u/h} Q_12>_2, and vTot is the unique covector with vTot . Psi_A = A_A. ---- *)\nClearAll[deg2A, Q12A, mu2A, poles2A, resMu2A, Nn2A, c2A, gA, cal2A, calTotA, vTotA];\ndeg2A = lamO[[2]];\nQ12A[A_, x_] := QDO[A, 1, x] QDO[A, 2, x - hO] - QDO[A, 2, x] QDO[A, 1, x - hO];\nmu2A[x_] := 1 / Product[nuO[3][x - k hO], {k, 0, deg2A}];\npoles2A = thO + hO Range[0, deg2A];\nresMu2A = Table[Residue[mu2A[x], {x, p}], {p, poles2A}];\nNn2A = 1 / resMu2A[[1]];\nc2A = resMu2A / resMu2A[[1]];\n\ngA[A_, x_] := k2^(x / hO) Q12A[A, x];\ncal2A = Table[Expand[Nn2A / gA[A, poles2A[[1]]] Sum[resMu2A[[m]] gA[A, poles2A[[m]]], {m, Length[poles2A]}]], {A, Length[statesO]}];\ncalTotA = Expand[calA cal2A];\nvTotA = Expand[calTotA . Inverse[PsiMatA]];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rep Λ[1]\", Row[lamO, \",\"]},\n        {\"poles of mu_2 (first = θ)\", poles2A},\n        {\"residues of mu_2\", resMu2A},\n        {\"Nn2\", Nn2A},\n        {\"c_m (second factor)\", c2A},\n        {\"min |Q_12(θ)| over states (must be nonzero)\", N[Min[Abs[Table[Q12A[A, thO], {A, Length[statesO]}]]], 3]},\n        {\"degree of second factor in k2\", Union[Exponent[#, k2] & /@ cal2A]},\n        {\"k2^0 part of vTot = previous v\", N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Coefficient[vTotA, k2, 0] - vA, k1]]]], 3]},\n        {\"max |vTot . Psi_A - A_A|\", N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vTotA . PsiMatA - calTotA, {k1, k2}]]]], 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
