  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Structure of vTot: nonzero components of vTot . g0^-1 by GT pattern, rationalized (the numeric point is rational). ---- *)\nClearAll[ratPolyA, vTotTildeA, vTotTildeRatA];\nratPolyA[p_] := Total[Rationalize[#[[2]], 10^-70] Times @@ ({k1, k2}^#[[1]]) & /@ CoefficientRules[p, {k1, k2}]];\nvTotTildeA = Expand[vTotA . Inverse[g0A]];\nvTotTildeRatA = ratPolyA /@ vTotTildeA;\n\nGrid[\n    Prepend[\n        Select[Transpose[{ps[{lamO}], vTotTildeRatA}], #[[2]] =!= 0 &] /. {pat_, c_} :> {pat, Factor[c]},\n        {\"GT pattern\", \"component of vTot . g0^-1\"}\n    ],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
