   "value": "(* ---- 8. Operator structure of vTot (adjoint). vTot is NOT of the form C e1^T exp(a E12) exp(b E13) exp(c E23) (no exact solution),\n   so fit the k2-linear part at k1 = 0 as e1^T (s + b23 E23 + b13 E13) . g0, then test the full vTot as an ordered product\n   e1^T X1 X2 . g0 or e1^T X2 X1 . g0 with X1 = (1 - k1 z1) + k1 p1 (z1 - z2) E12 (the first factor) and X2 = 1 + k2 (s + b23 E23 + b13 E13). ---- *)\nClearAll[e1A, v2TildeA, fit2A, fit2ResA, X1A, X2A, prod12A, prod21A];\ne1A = UnitVector[dsO, 1];\nv2TildeA = Coefficient[Coefficient[vTotTildeRatA, k1, 0], k2, 1];\nfit2A = Solve[Thread[e1A . (s0 IdentityMatrix[dsO] + b23 Ee[1][2, 3] + b13 Ee[1][1, 3]) == v2TildeA], {s0, b23, b13}];\nfit2ResA = fit2A =!= {};\nX1A = (1 - k1 z[1]) IdentityMatrix[dsO] + k1 p1 (z[1] - z[2]) Ee[1][1, 2] /. ptO;\nX2A = If[fit2ResA, IdentityMatrix[dsO] + k2 (s0 IdentityMatrix[dsO] + b23 Ee[1][2, 3] + b13 Ee[1][1, 3]) /. First[fit2A], 0];\nprod12A = Expand[e1A . X1A . X2A] - vTotTildeRatA;\nprod21A = Expand[e1A . X2A . X1A] - vTotTildeRatA;\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"k2-linear part at k1 = 0 fits e1^T (s + b23 E23 + b13 E13)\", fit2ResA},\n        {\"s, b23, b13\", If[fit2ResA, {s0, b23, b13} /. First[fit2A], \"-\"]},\n        {\"z1 z2, z1 z3, z2 z3 at this point\", {z[1] z[2], z[1] z[3], z[2] z[3]} /. ptO},\n        {\"vTot . g0^-1 = e1^T X1 X2 exactly\", If[fit2ResA, Union[Flatten[prod12A]] === {0}, \"-\"]},\n        {\"vTot . g0^-1 = e1^T X2 X1 exactly\", If[fit2ResA, Union[Flatten[prod21A]] === {0}, \"-\"]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"272\" data-out-n=\"3086\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"15\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3086]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.05em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.295em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.415em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k2-linear part at k1 = 0 fits e1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><s