      {
       "data": "Out[3086]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{k2-linear part at k1 = 0 fits e1\\^{}T (s + b23 E23 + b13 E13)} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{s, b23, b13} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\text{z1 z2, z1 z3, z2 z3 at this point} & \\left\\{\\frac{35}{6},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{2}{5}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{vTot . g0\\^{}-1 = e1\\^{}T X1 X2 exactly} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\text{vTot . g0\\^{}-1 = e1\\^{}T X2 X1 exactly} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
