  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. Claim: <vTot| = <v_old| (1 + r1 t[{1,1}](θ) + r2 t[{2,2}](θ) + ...), one fused transfer matrix per power of k2 (up to λ2),\n   with the normalized fused transfer matrices\n     t[{1,1}](u) = tG[2](u) / (ν1(u) ν1(u-h)),\n     t[{2,2}](u) = (tG[2](u) tG[2](u+h) - tG[3](u+h) tG[1](u)) / (ν1(u) ν1(u-h) ν1(u+h) ν1(u)).\n   Psi_A are eigenvectors of all of them, so the claim holds iff (second factor - 1) = sum_n r_n tau_n,A(θ) with the same r_n for all\n   states; the r_n are fit by least squares, order by order in k2, over all states. resultsB is NOT cleared: one row per rep. ---- *)\nClearAll[denOA, t11MatA, t22MatA, termMatsA, termEigA, rFitA, rSpreadA, vClaimA];\nIf[! AssociationQ[resultsB], resultsB = <||>];\ndenOA[x_] := nuO[1][x] nuO[1][x - hO];\nt11MatA = N[(tPolyO[2] /. u -> thO) / denOA[thO], precO];\nt22MatA = N[((tPolyO[2] /. u -> thO) . (tPolyO[2] /. u -> thO + hO) - (tPolyO[3] /. u -> thO + hO) . (tPolyO[1] /. u -> thO))\n    / (denOA[thO] denOA[thO + hO]), precO];\ntermMatsA = Take[{t11MatA, t22MatA}, deg2A];\n(* eigenvalues from the polynomial eigenvalues t1, t2, t3 of each state *)\ntermEigA = Table[\n    With[{t1 = s[\"t\"][[1]], t2 = s[\"t\"][[2]], t3 = s[\"t\"][[3]]},\n        Take[{(t2 /. u -> thO) / denOA[thO],\n              ((t2 /. u -> thO) (t2 /. u -> thO + hO) - (t3 /. u -> thO + hO) (t1 /. u -> thO)) / (denOA[thO] denOA[thO + hO])}, deg2A]],\n    {s, statesO}];\n\n(* order by order in k2: (second factor - 1) at k2^j = termEig . r(j) *)\nrFitA = Sum[k2^j LeastSquares[termEigA, Coefficient[cal2A - 1, k2, j]], {j, 1, deg2A}];\nrSpreadA = N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[termEigA . rFitA - (cal2A - 1), k2]]]], 3];\nvClaimA = Expand[vA . (IdentityMatrix[dsO] + rFitA . termMatsA)];\nresultsB[lamO] = {\n    ptIndexO,\n    ratPolyA /@ rFitA,\n    rSpreadA,\n    N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vClaimA - vTotA, {k1, k2}]]]], 3]\n};\n\nGrid[\n    Prepend[KeyValueMap[Prepend[#2, Row[#1, \",\"]] &, resultsB],\n        {\"rep\", \"point\", \"r_n (coefficient of t[{1,1}], t[{2,2}], ...)\", \"max |second factor - 1 - sum r tau| over states\", \"max |v_old (1 + sum r t) - vTot|\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
