  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Structure of $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|$: a line and a plane that are no longer incident (cells 19–23)\n\n- **Local form.** $\\nu_1(\\theta)\\nu_1(\\theta-h)\\,t_{\\{1,1\\}}(\\theta)=h^2\\sum_{i<j}z_iz_j\\,[E_{ii}(1+E_{jj})-E_{ij}E_{ji}]$ (verified symbolically). On the highest-weight bra only the column set $J=\\{1,2\\}$ survives:\n  - $e_1^T\\,\\mathrm{qminor}_{12,12}(\\theta)=h^2\\lambda_2(1+\\lambda_1)\\,e_1^T$\n  - $e_1^T\\,\\mathrm{qminor}_{13,12}(\\theta)=h^2(1+\\lambda_1)\\,e_1^TE_{23}$\n  - $e_1^T\\,\\mathrm{qminor}_{23,12}(\\theta)=h^2\\,e_1^T\\big(E_{12}E_{23}-(1+\\lambda_2)E_{13}\\big)$\n\n  The quadratic $E_{12}E_{23}$ is why $v_{\\rm tot}$ is not a group-rotated vacL.\n- **From $\\langle v_1|$ to the highest-weight bra** (cell 23, adjoint, exact). $\\langle v_1|=c\\,e_1^T\\rho(g_1)$ with $g_1=e^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}$ and $c=(1-k_1z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}$. By covariance, $\\rho(g_1)\\,t^{G}(\\theta)\\,\\rho(g_1)^{-1}=t^{G_1}(\\theta)$ with $G_1=g_1Gg_1^{-1}$ (upper triangular, taken with plain matrix units in the auxiliary space). By quantum Cauchy–Binet, $t^M_2(u)=\\sum_{I,J}\\mathrm{qminor}_{I,J}(u)\\det M_{J,I}$. Hence\n$$\n\\langle v_1|\\,t_2^G(\\theta)=c\\sum_{I}\\det(G_1)_{\\{1,2\\},I}\\;e_1^T\\,\\mathrm{qminor}_{I,\\{1,2\\}}(\\theta)\\,\\rho(g_1),\n$$\n  which is where the column-$\\{1,2\\}$ survival above is used.\n- **Borel–Weil picture.** vacL is the flag (line $\\ell_0$ inside plane $\\pi_0$) of $g_0$, entering as $\\ell^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}\\otimes\\pi^{\\lambda_2}$. Let $P$ be the equivariant projection of $\\mathrm{Sym}^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}(\\mathbb C^3)\\otimes\\mathrm{Sym}^{\\lambda_2}(\\Lambda^2\\mathbb C^3)$ onto $V_\\lambda$. Then\n$$\n\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\propto P\\Big(\\ell_0(1-k_1G)\\,,\\;\\prod_{m=1}^{\\lambda_2}\\pi_0\\,(1-\\kappa_m k_2\\,\\Lambda^2G)\\Big),\\qquad \\prod_{m=1}^{\\lambda_2}(1-\\kappa_m y)={}_2F_1(-\\lambda_2,-\\lambda_2;-\\lambda_1;y),\n$$\n  where the planes are symmetrized. So $k_1$ moves only the line and $k_2$ only the plane(s).\n  - For $\\lambda_2=1$: $\\kappa=1/\\lambda_1$.\n  - The line part has all its factors equal, $(1-k_1z_i)$.\n  - Once the line leaves the plane, $P$ is no longer a coherent state. For the adjoint this is literally $M=x'y'^T-\\tfrac13(y'\\!\\cdot x')\\,\\mathbb 1$ with $y'\\!\\cdot x'\\neq0$ (cell 20).\n- **Evidence.** Exact at all orders in $k_1,k_2$ at point 1 for $[2,1,0]$, $[3,1,0]$, $[2,2,0]$, $[3,2,0]$, $[4,2,0]$. The $\\kappa$'s are $\\{\\tfrac12\\},\\{\\tfrac13\\},\\{1,1\\},\\{\\tfrac13,1\\},\\{\\tfrac{3\\mp\\sqrt3}{6}\\}$.\n  - The ${}_2F_1$ form is *fitted* to these five reps (all $\\lambda_2\\le2$, $\\lambda_3=0$).\n  - Testing it at $\\lambda_2=3$ needs $t_{\\{3,3\\}}$ and a three-plane product, not yet built.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 10. Local structure of t[{1,1}](θ). With T_ab(u) = (u-θ) δ_ab - h E_ba, the 2x2 quantum minor at u = θ is\n   T_ii(θ) T_jj(θ-h) - T_ji(θ) T_ij(θ-h) = h^2 [E_ii (1 + E_jj) - E_ij E_ji], so tG[2](θ) = h^2 sum_{i<j} z_i z_j [E_ii (1 + E_jj) - E_ij E_ji].\n   Then test whether vTot and the separate pieces vacL.t[{1,1}](θ), v.t[{1,1}](θ) are rescaled highest-weight covectors\n   C e1^T exp(a E12) exp(b E13) exp(c E23) (exact Solve for C, a, b, c). ---- *)\nClearAll[minorGenA, hwAnsatzA, coherentTestA, w0A, w1A];\nminorGenA[i_, j_] := Ee[1][i, i] . (IdentityMatrix[dsO] + Ee[1][j, j]) - Ee[1][i, j] . Ee[1][j, i];\nhwAnsatzA[cc_, a_, b_, c_] := cc UnitVector[dsO, 1] . MatrixExp[a Ee[1][1, 2]] . MatrixExp[b Ee[1][1, 3]] . MatrixExp[c Ee[1][2, 3]];\ncoherentTestA[w_] := Module[{sol = Solve[Thread[hwAnsatzA[cc, a, b, c] == (ratPolyA /@ w)], {cc, a, b, c}]},\n    If[sol === {}, \"not coherent\", Factor[{cc, a, b, c} /. First[sol]]]];\n(* rationalized pieces; w1 keeps k1 symbolic *)\nw0A = vacLO . t11MatA;\nw1A = Expand[vA . t11MatA];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"tG[2](θ) = h^2 sum z_i z_j [E_ii(1+E_jj) - E_ij E_ji]  (symbolic)\",\n            Simplify[tG[2][θ[1]] - h^2 Sum[z[i] z[j] minorGenA[i, j], {i, 1, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}]] === ConstantArray[0, {dsO, dsO}]},\n        {\"vacL (p1, p2, p3) at this point\", {p1, p2, p3} /. rotparams /. ptO},\n        {\"vacL itself: {C, a, b, c} (sanity: C = 1, a = p1, b = p2, c = p3)\", coherentTestA[vacLO]},\n        {\"vTot (k1, k2 symbolic): {C, a, b, c}\", coherentTestA[vTotA]},\n        {\"vTot at k1 = 0: {C, a, b, c}\", coherentTestA[vTotA /. k1 -> 0]},\n        {\"vacL . t[{1,1}](θ): {C, a, b, c}\", coherentTestA[w0A]},\n        {\"v . t[{1,1}](θ) (k1 symbolic): {C, a, b, c}\", coherentTestA[w1A]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"280\" data-out-n=\"3171\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"18\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"25\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3171]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"28\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.46em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.46em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.42em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.96em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.46em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.62em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tG[2](</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">) = h</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><