  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 11. Adjoint only: Borel-Weil test. A covector of the adjoint is a traceless 3x3 matrix M; highest-weight (coherent) covectors are\n   M = x y^T with y.x = 0 (line x inside plane y). A (line, plane) pair NOT in a flag projects to M = x y^T - (y.x)/3 Id, i.e. rank(M + c Id) = 1\n   for c = (y.x)/3. The intertwiner Phi (row covector -> M) is fixed, up to scale, by sl(3) equivariance M(w . E) = [M(w), e]\n   (the center E11+E22+E33 acts as a scalar on the rep but trivially on matrices, so it is left out). ---- *)\nClearAll[eijA, gensA, PhiA, phiSolA, matOfA, rank1TestA];\neijA[i_, j_] := Normal[SparseArray[{{i, j} -> 1}, {3, 3}]];\ngensA = Join[\n    Flatten[Table[If[i != j, {Ee[1][i, j], eijA[i, j]}, Nothing], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], 1],\n    {{Ee[1][1, 1] - Ee[1][2, 2], eijA[1, 1] - eijA[2, 2]}, {Ee[1][2, 2] - Ee[1][3, 3], eijA[2, 2] - eijA[3, 3]}}];\nphiSolA = Quiet @ Module[{vars = Array[phi, {3, 3, dsO}], eqs},\n    eqs = Flatten @ Table[\n        With[{w = UnitVector[dsO, n]}, (vars . (w . g[[1]])) - ((vars . w) . g[[2]] - g[[2]] . (vars . w))],\n        {n, dsO}, {g, gensA}];\n    Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], Flatten[vars]]];\nPhiA = With[{P = Array[phi, {3, 3, dsO}] /. First[phiSolA]}, P /. Thread[Variables[P] -> 1]];\nmatOfA[w_] := PhiA . w;\n(* rank(M + c Id) = 1 for some c: all 2x2 minors of M + c Id share a common root c *)\nrank1TestA[w_] := Module[{M = matOfA[w], cs, minors},\n    minors = DeleteCases[Flatten[Minors[M + cvar IdentityMatrix[3], 2]] // Expand, 0];\n    cs = Solve[Thread[minors == 0], cvar];\n    If[cs === {}, \"no c\", {cvar /. First[cs], MatrixRank[M + (cvar /. First[cs]) IdentityMatrix[3]]}]];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"intertwiner unique up to scale\", Length[phiSolA] == 1 && FreeQ[PhiA, phi] && PhiA =!= 0 PhiA},\n        {\"vacL: {Tr M, rank M, M.M = 0}  (coherent: nilpotent rank 1)\", With[{M = matOfA[ratPolyA /@ vacLO]}, {Tr[M], MatrixRank[M], M . M == 0 M}]},\n        {\"v (Q_1 part only) at k1 = 1/7: {Tr M, rank M, M.M = 0}\", With[{M = matOfA[ratPolyA /@ vA /. k1 -> 1/7]}, {Tr[M], MatrixRank[M], M . M == 0 M}]},\n        {\"vTot at k1 = 1/7, k2 = 2/9: {c, rank(M + c Id)}\", rank1TestA[ratPolyA /@ vTotA /. {k1 -> 1/7, k2 -> 2/9}]},\n        {\"vTot at k1 = -3/5, k2 = 5/4: {c, rank(M + c Id)}\", rank1TestA[ratPolyA /@ vTotA /. {k1 -> -3/5, k2 -> 5/4}]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"275\" data-out-n=\"3112\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"31\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3112]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.06em;vertical-align:-2.76em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.3em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.02em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.76em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.26em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.42em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">intertwiner unique up to scale</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vacL: {Tr M, rank M, M.M = 0} (coherent: nilpotent rank 1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.02em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v (Q_1 part only) at k1 = 1/7: {Tr M, rank M, M.M = 0}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vTot at k1 = 1/7, k2 = 2/9: {c, rank(M + c Id)}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vTot at k1 = -3/5, k2 = 5/4: {c, rank(M + c Id)}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.76em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.02em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.76em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.26em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.42em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.22em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.02em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">19845</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">326</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1764</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">163</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.76em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.02em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.76em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.12em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.52em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.26em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.76em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
