t:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">none</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.56em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.62em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.56em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.52em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.72em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.92em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.12em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.06em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.56em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[3130]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline & \\text{\\{kappa, vTot = P(ell(k1), pi(k2)) exactly (all k1, k2), scalar vTot/P\\}}\\\\\\hline\\text{V\\_$\\lambda$ embeds in W (Psi rank)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{vacL = P(ell0, pi0) (k1 = k2 = 0, up to scale)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline2,1,0 & \\left\\{\\left\\{\\frac{1}{2}\\right\\},\\mathrm{True},2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3,1,0 & \\left\\{\\left\\{\\frac{1}{3}\\right\\},\\mathrm{True},1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3,2,0 & \\left\\{\\text{none},\\mathrm{False},\\text{-}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline2,2,0 & \\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\mathrm{True},1\\right\\}\\\\\\hline4,2,0 & \\left\\{\\text{none},\\mathrm{False},\\text{-}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "f3578c70-9c74-428d-85c1-7b5c56a51539"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 13. λ2 = 2 (e.g. [3,2,0]): a single deformed plane pi(k2)^2 does not fit (cell 20). Test two different planes, symmetrized:\n   vTot = P(ell(k1), pi_a pi_b),  pi_x = pi0 . (1 - x k2 Lambda^2 G),  with pi_a pi_b = [(pi_a + pi_b)^2 - pi_a^2 - pi_b^2]/2\n   (every 2-vector in C^3 is decomposable, so the sum of two planes is again a plane). kappa1, kappa2 are fit. ---- *)\nClearAll[planeSqA, omega2A, Pcov2, kap2FitA, conj2A, conj2ResA];\n(* covector of V[λ2,λ2,0] for the Lambda^2 vector pi0 . diag(a12, a13, a23), homogeneous of degree λ2 in the a's *)\nplaneSqA[aa_] := UnitVector[dim[repBA], 1] . g0RepA[repBA] . diagRepA[repBA, Function[{m1, m2, m3},\n    aa[[1]]^(lamO[[2]] - m3) aa[[2]]^(lamO[[2]] - m2) aa[[3]]^(lamO[[2]] - m1)]];\nomega2A[ka_, kb_] := Module[{zz = {z[1], z[2], z[3]} /. ptO, A, B, lineCov},\n    A = {1 - ka k2 zz[[1]] zz[[2]], 1 - ka k2 zz[[1]] zz[[3]], 1 - ka k2 zz[[2]] zz[[3]]};\n    B = {1 - kb k2 zz[[1]] zz[[2]], 1 - kb k2 zz[[1]] zz[[3]], 1 - kb k2 zz[[2]] zz[[3]]};\n    lineCov = UnitVector[dim[repAA], 1] . g0RepA[repAA] . diagRepA[repAA, Function[{m1, m2, m3}, Times @@ ((1 - k1 zz)^{m1, m2, m3})]];\n    Flatten[KroneckerProduct[{lineCov}, {(planeSqA[A + B] - planeSqA[A] - planeSqA[B]) / 2}]]];\nPcov2[ka_, kb_] := LinearSolve[Transpose[PsiEmbA], omega2A[ka, kb] . projWA];\n\nkap2FitA = If[lamO[[2]] =!= 2, \"only for λ2 = 2\",\n    Module[{pts = {{1/7, 2/9}, {-3/5, 5/4}}, eqs, sols},\n        eqs = Flatten @ Table[Flatten[Minors[{Pcov2[ka, kb] /. Thread[{k1, k2} -> pt], ratPolyA /@ vTotA /. Thread[{k1, k2} -> pt]}, 2]], {pt, pts}];\n        sols = Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], {ka, kb}];\n        If[sols === {}, \"none\", {ka, kb} /. sols]]];\nconj2A = If[ListQ[kap2FitA], Pcov2 @@ First[kap2FitA], 0];\nconj2ResA = If[ListQ[kap2FitA], Union[Flatten[Together[conj2A / conj2A[[1]] - (ratPolyA /@ vTotA) / (ratPolyA /@ vTotA)[[1]]]]] === {0}, \"-\"];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"rep\", Row[lamO, \",\"]},\n        {\"(kappa1, kappa2) solutions\", kap2FitA},\n        {\"vTot = P(ell(k1), pi_a pi_b) exactly (all k1, k2)\", conj2ResA},\n        {\"scalar vTot / P\", If[ListQ[kap2FitA], Factor[(ratPolyA /@ vTotA)[[1]] / conj2A[[1]]], \"-\"]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"277\" data-out-n=\"3138\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"21\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"30\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3138]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.84em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(kappa1, kappa2) solutions</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vTot = P(ell(k1), pi_a pi_b) exactly (all k1, k2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scalar vTot / P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">only for </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">2 = 2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[3138]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{rep} & 2,1,0\\\\\\hline\\text{(kappa1, kappa2) solutions} & \\text{only for $\\lambda$2 = 2}\\\\\\hline\\text{vTot = P(ell(k1), pi\\_a pi\\_b) exactly (all k1, k2)} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\text{scalar vTot / P} & \\text{-}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
