  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 14. From <v1| to the highest-weight bra. <v1| = c e1^T rho(g1), g1 = exp(p1' E12) exp(p2 E13) exp(p3 E23). Covariance moves rho(g1)\n   through the transfer matrix at the cost of conjugating the twist, and quantum Cauchy-Binet gives, for any 3x3 twist M,\n     t2^M(u) = sum_{I,J} qminor_{I,J}(u) det M[J, I]   (tG[2] = t2^G with G = diag(z)).\n   The auxiliary space uses plain matrix units e_ij, so g1 is taken there as exp(p1' e12) exp(p2 e13) exp(p3 e23)\n   (the GT fundamental JJ[.,.,{1,0,0}] is only a rescaled copy, e.g. JJ[1,3] = 2 e13).\n   Check: (a) Cauchy-Binet reproduces tG[2]; (b) which conjugate G1 of G gives rho(g1) t2^G(θ) rho(g1)^-1 = t2^{G1}(θ);\n   (c) <v1| t2^G(θ) = c e1^T t2^{G1}(θ) rho(g1), and (c') e1^T t2^{G1}(θ) = sum_I det G1[{1,2}, I] e1^T qminor_{I,{1,2}}(θ). ---- *)\nClearAll[setsA, t2MA, k1ValA, g1FundA, g1RepA, GzA, candA, candOkA, G1A, v1ValA, cValA];\nsetsA = Subsets[Range[3], {2}];\nt2MA[M_, x_] := Sum[QM[I2, J2][x] Det[M[[J2, I2]]], {I2, setsA}, {J2, setsA}];\nk1ValA = 1/7;\nGzA = DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}] /. ptO;\n(* g1 at k1 = 1/7 in the site rep, and in the auxiliary space with plain matrix units *)\ng1RepA[rr_] := MatrixExp[(p1 (1 - k1 z[2]) / (1 - k1 z[1])) JJ[1, 2, rr]] . MatrixExp[p2 JJ[1, 3, rr]] . MatrixExp[p3 JJ[2, 3, rr]] /. rotparams /. ptO /. k1 -> k1ValA;\ng1FundA = MatrixExp[(p1 (1 - k1 z[2]) / (1 - k1 z[1])) eijA[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 eijA[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3 eijA[2, 3]] /. rotparams /. ptO /. k1 -> k1ValA;\n(* conjugation conventions to try *)\ncandA = {g1FundA . GzA . Inverse[g1FundA], Inverse[g1FundA] . GzA . g1FundA,\n    Transpose[g1FundA] . GzA . Inverse[Transpose[g1FundA]], Inverse[Transpose[g1FundA]] . GzA . Transpose[g1FundA]};\ncandOkA = Table[\n    Simplify[(g1RepA[lamO] . (t2MA[GzA, θ[1]] /. ptO) . Inverse[g1RepA[lamO]]) - (t2MA[M, θ[1]] /. ptO)] === ConstantArray[0, {dsO, dsO}],\n    {M, candA}];\nG1A = If[Or @@ candOkA, candA[[First[Flatten[Position[candOkA, True]]]]], $Failed];\nv1ValA = ratPolyA /@ vA /. k1 -> k1ValA;\ncValA = (1 - k1ValA z[1] /. ptO)^(lamO[[1]] - lamO[[2]]);\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"(a) Cauchy-Binet: t2^G(u) = tG[2](u)\", Simplify[t2MA[DiagonalMatrix[{z[1], z[2], z[3]}], u] - tG[2][u]] === ConstantArray[0, {dsO, dsO}]},\n        {\"(b) rho(g1) t2^G rho(g1)^-1 = t2^{G1} for G1 = {g G g^-1, g^-1 G g, g^T G g^-T, g^-T G g^T}\", candOkA},\n        {\"<v1| = c e1^T rho(g1) at k1 = 1/7\", v1ValA == cValA UnitVector[dsO, 1] . g1RepA[lamO]},\n        {\"(c) <v1| t2^G(θ) = c e1^T t2^{G1}(θ) rho(g1)\", If[G1A === $Failed, \"-\",\n            Simplify[v1ValA . (t2MA[GzA, θ[1]] /. ptO) - cValA UnitVector[dsO, 1] . (t2MA[G1A, θ[1]] /. ptO) . g1RepA[lamO]] === ConstantArray[0, dsO]]},\n        {\"(c') e1^T t2^{G1}(θ) = sum_I det G1[{1,2}, I] e1^T qminor_{I,{1,2}}(θ)\", If[G1A === $Failed, \"-\",\n            Simplify[UnitVector[dsO, 1] . (t2MA[G1A, θ[1]] /. ptO) - Sum[Det[G1A[[{1, 2}, I2]]] UnitVector[dsO, 1] . (QM[I2, {1, 2}][θ[1]] /. ptO), {I2, setsA}]] === ConstantArray[0, dsO]]},\n        {\"G1 = g1 G g1^-1 (upper triangular, diagonal = z)\", If[G1A === $Failed, \"-\", MatrixForm[G1A]]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557203\" data-output-id=\"279\" data-out-n=\"3164\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"37\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[3164]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"26\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.6553em;vertical-align:-4.5577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0977em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.0577em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0577em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6153em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.5577em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0577em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.2753em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0577em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(a) Cauchy-Binet: t2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></spa